# Time Elements source art and baked sheets — purchased assets, never committed.
#
# The packs normally live outside the repo entirely (SourcePacks takes absolute paths, so
# nothing here depends on a location), which is why none of this is tracked today. These
# rules are the guard for when that stops being true by accident: a pack copied in for
# convenience, or an export directory pointed at the working tree.
#
# Scoped to the pack's own assets/<slot>/ shape rather than a bare "assets/" — core.ignorecase
# is true on Windows, so that would also swallow src/TheOmenDen.PixelForge/Assets/, which holds
# the MSIX tile logos and must stay tracked. Slot names are AssetSlot's members, lowercased;
# they are the pack's folder names.
**/assets/shadow/
**/assets/backextra/
**/assets/backhair/
**/assets/bottom/
**/assets/top/
**/assets/head/
**/assets/hair/
**/assets/frontextra/
**/assets/hat/
**/assets/weapon/

# Baked sheets. Lossless WebP is only ever written by this app, never checked in.
*.webp
